  "headline": "Cyclophosphamide is not on FDA's shortage list; Corvale sites hold 20-22 days supply; top alternate is Avenacy from EPIC PHARMA LLC",
  "headline_cites": ["D3", "D1", "D2", "D4"],
  "sentences": [
    {"text": "FDA's drug shortage list does not include cyclophosphamide as of 2026-10-21.", "cites": ["D3"]},
    {"text": "Corvale East has 54 vials of the 2 g/100 mL presentation, providing 20.4 days on hand at 2.7 vials per day.", "cites": ["D1"]},
    {"text": "Corvale General has 62 vials of the same presentation, providing 21.6 days on hand at 2.9 vials per day.", "cites": ["D2"]},
    {"text": "The label for NDC 65219013320 identifies Jiangsu Hengrui Pharmaceuticals Co., Ltd. (Jinqiao Road Site) as the registered plant for API manufacture and packaging.", "cites": ["E5"]},
    {"text": "That plant received a VAI classification on 2018-04-13 (known 2018-06-14) and again on 2026-04-15 (known 2026-07-14).", "cites": ["E3", "E4"]},
    {"text": "The rule-ranked first alternate is to buy from Avenacy, LLC, which is not on FDA's shortage list today and uses EPIC PHARMA LLC.", "cites": ["D4"]},
    {"text": "Check whether the Jiangsu Hengrui site's VAI history affects supply continuity and confirm Avenacy availability before ordering.", "cites": ["E3", "E4", "D4"]}
